\paragraph{Scope and outlook.}
Reward-accuracy decoupling holds across all tested sparsity levels ($|\Delta| \leq 1$\,pp at 15--25\%), with initial generality evidence across scales (1.5B) and architectures (Qwen2.5-Math-7B).
Our findings concern fine-grained structural pruning; extension to unstructured~\citep{selfhealing2025} or online rollout pruning~\citep{xu2026arrol} remains open. Code, pruning masks, and model checkpoints will be released upon acceptance.

